OL,3,GNEWSAGirl honoured for shielding sister
OL,4,Ain Southport attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA girl who shielded her younger sister
OL,7,Fduring the Southport attack has
OL,8,Freceived a national bravery award.
OL,10,FThe girl, who cannot be named for legal
OL,11,Freasons, suffered life-threatening
OL,12,Finjuries after being stabbed during the
OL,13,Fattack at a Taylor Swift-themed dance
OL,14,Fworkshop on 29 July 2024.
OL,16,FMerseyside Police said the girl had
OL,17,Fsuffered serious injuries but "then
OL,18,Finstinctively placed herself between
OL,19,Fthe attacker and her sister".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
