OL,3,GNEWSAGirl honoured for shielding sister
OL,4,Ain Southport attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was one of four people from
OL,7,FMerseyside to receive gold awards at
OL,8,Fthe National Police Chiefs' Council's
OL,9,FPolice Public Bravery Awards.
